---
import CtaButton from './CtaButton.astro'
---

<section
  class="bg-[color:var(--ss-color-background)] px-6 py-24 border-t-[3px] border-[color:var(--ss-color-text-primary)]"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span
        class="inline-block bg-[color:var(--ss-color-text-primary)] text-[color:var(--ss-color-background)] font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] px-2 py-1 mb-4"
        >Another Way</span
      >
      <h2
        class="font-['Archivo'] text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-[-0.02em] text-[color:var(--ss-color-text-primary)]"
      >
        Or, Hire An AI Employee That Stays.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-6">
        <p
          class="font-['Archivo'] text-lg leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--ss-color-text-secondary)]"
        >
          Everything above describes a scoped engagement with a defined start and finish. There is a
          second way to work with us, and it does not end at handoff.
        </p>
        <p
          class="font-['Archivo'] text-lg leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--ss-color-text-secondary)]"
        >
          We build a dedicated AI worker for your business and operate it as a flat monthly
          subscription. It runs on isolated infrastructure for your business, plugs into the tools
          you already use, and learns how your business actually works. Early on it drafts and your
          team reviews. As you sign off on specific kinds of work, it does more of that work on its
          own.
        </p>
        <p
          class="font-['Archivo'] text-lg leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--ss-color-text-secondary)]"
        >
          The worker stays. It keeps learning your voice, your standards, and the patterns of the
          work. The memory is yours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <CtaButton href="/ai-employee" data-ev="home-ai-employee-cta"
        >See how the AI Employee works</CtaButton
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
